@startuml
[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Idle: Signal::Start\n[inport_empty()]
Stopped --> Running: Signal::Start\n[!inport_empty()]
Idle --> Stopped: Signal::Stop
Idle --> Running: Signal::LoadPart(part)\n[inport_free()\n&& process_empty()\n&& outport.free()]
Idle --> Running: Signal::UnloadPart()\n[!inport_empty()\n&& process_empty()\n&& outport.free() ]
Idle --> Idle: Signal::LoadPart(part)\n[inport_free()\n&& (! process_empty()\n|| ! outport.free())]
Running --> Running: Signal::UnoadPart
Running --> Running: Signal::LoadPart(part)
Running --> Running: Signal::ProcessFinished\n[ ! inport_empty() ]
Running --> Idle: Signal::ProcessFinished\n[ inport_empty() ] 
Running --> Stopping: Stop
Running --> Stopped: Signal::Abort
Stopping --> Stopping: Signal::UnloadPart
Stopping --> Stopping: Signal::LoadPart(part)
Stopping --> Stopped: Signal::ProcessFinished
@enduml